Package: uzunyx-maxgesture
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: kwin-wayland (>= @KWIN@), kwin-wayland (<< @KWIN@.~)
Recommends: uzunyx-deco (>= 0.14.1)
Description: the maximize button of every window also does fullscreen
 KWin plugin. Shift + click on the maximize button of any window, or
 holding it pressed for half a second, puts the window in fullscreen
 instead of maximizing it. It works with apps that draw their own title
 bar (GTK, libadwaita, Electron, Firefox), which can't get a fourth
 button, as well as with KWin's own decoration. A plain click still
 maximizes and restores. With uzunyx-deco, the fullscreen window goes to a
 virtual desktop of its own.
 .
 Built against one exact KWin version: KWin refuses to load it in any
 other, so it must be rebuilt after every KWin update.
